Usertags: alpha ia64

Hello!

binutils is currently BD-Uninstallable on alpha and ia64 because it build-depends
on the libc6-dev package on these architectures. However, neither alpha nor ia64
provide that package, they actually have a libc6.1-dev package.

Thanks,
Adrian

